          "media": {
            "duration": 6997,
            "fileSize": 113288071
          },
          "author": "J.M. Barrie",
          "description": "A Yoto Original adaptation of the classic novel by J.M. Barrie. The perfect introduction to this celebrated story for young listeners. Narrated by Nick Mohammed and brought to life with music, sound effects and a full cast. \n\nWhen Peter Pan flies through the window of the Darling family nursery\non one never-to-be-forgotten Friday, the stage is set for an incredible adventure. Together, with the help of some fairy dust, Wendy, John and Michael fly off with Peter and Tinkerbell to the magical shores of Neverland; a place created in one’s own imagination. A place where children never grow up. \n\nWhen they arrive, they find magic and adventure around every corner. There are mermaid lagoons, tropical forests, fairy ceremonies, and tik-tiking crocodiles. But danger awaits too. The nefarious Captain Hook and his band of pirates are out to get Peter. \n\nCan the Darling children team up with Peter and the lost boys to defeat Hook? And will they ever make it back home to reunite with their parents? \n\nA story of friendship, adventure and the magic of childhood that’s enchanted listeners of all ages for generations. \n\nCreated in collaboration with Great Ormond Street Hospital Children’s Charity. \n6% of the retail price (plus VAT) of each product sold will be donated to Great Ormond Street Hospital Children’s Charity (GOSH Charity) (Registered Charity No. 1160024) by Yoto Limited. Donations attributed to the sale of this product will contribute to Yoto’s commitment to raising a minimum of £100,000 for GOSH Charity by 28th February 2027.\n",
